Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Have you fully healed from, you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}know, what happened in Jersey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ジャージーで起きたこと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}もう完全に癒えた？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}where you got shot seven times?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}7発も撃たれたやつ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Have you fully healed from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}完全に回復したの？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because that has to be a type of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}trauma that it's like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あれってトラウマになるじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}you're continuously looking over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ずっと背後を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}警戒し続けるような
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You're continuously making sure you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}make the right moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}常に正しく動けてるか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}気を張ってるような
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:10.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Have you healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:10.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}回復した？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It's crazy, though. Like, today, day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}and age,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それがヤバくてさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}最近になって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}like, yeah, I be catching myself like,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}oh, that PTSD done worn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「あれ、PTSD抜けてんじゃん」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ふと気づく時があんのよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It worn off already?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.34,0:00:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}もう抜けたの？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, I ain't gonna lie, it got like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ああ、正直
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:21.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}だいぶ良くなったよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It was bad, it was bad, you feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}It was bad, you feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ひどかったよ、マジでひどかった
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ほんとにひどかったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And like, it's like, it feels like a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}better right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}でも今は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:28.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}だいぶ楽になった感じ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I'm like a lot more like, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}前よりずっと…わかるだろ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Did you do something for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Like therapy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}何かしたの？セラピーとか
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I ain't do nothing. Like, I'm like kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}of like an introvert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}何もしてねぇよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺ってちょっと内向的だからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I ain't do physical therapy, I ain't do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}mental therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}リハビリもしてねぇし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}メンタルのセラピーもしてねぇ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:40.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I just got the f**k away from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:40.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}everybody and just... figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:40.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}とにかく全員から離れて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:40.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}自分でどうにかしたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So you just isolated yourself. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}じゃあ一人で引きこもってたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ああ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You were by yourself the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ずっと一人で？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, basically. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.60,0:00:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}まぁ、基本的にはな
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:48.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Do you move differently now with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:48.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}that situation happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:48.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あの件があってから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:48.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}動き方は変わった？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:49.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Because that's a scary situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:49.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}だって怖い状況じゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Most people don't live off of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}one shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}普通は1発でも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}生き残れないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}but the fact that you were hit seven
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}times is very serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}7発も食らったって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}相当ヤバいことだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And actually, you know what's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}crazy, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}てか実際、ヤバいのがさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I actually might have been more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:57.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}実はもっと多かったかもしんねぇ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You know, in the hospital, they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}say more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}病院じゃもっと多いって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:59.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}言われてんのよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}The news headline, seven, and I just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}let it rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}ニュースの見出しは7発で
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺はそのままにしといた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I just left it at seven. I ain't f**king
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}with you on seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}7発ってことにしといたけど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}7発どころじゃねぇよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:06.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}How many times was it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:06.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}実際は何発だったの？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}It was like eight, nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}8発か9発くらい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}But you know this? I got f**king mad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}holes and s**t.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}それにさ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}体中マジで穴だらけなんだよ
